@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Modern Web Application Architecture" {
    
    [React Frontend] as UI
    note right of UI
      UI / Components, 
      State management, 
      User interactions, 
      Search & filtering.
    end note

    [FastAPI (REST) Backend] as API
    note right of API
      Handles REST API requests,
      Business logic,
      Authentication & authorization.
    end note

    database "PostgreSQL" as DB
    note bottom of DB
      Relational database for:
      Movies, Users, Ratings,
      Genres, Favorites.
    end note

    database "Redis (Optional)" as Cache
    note bottom of Cache
      In-memory data store for:
      Caching, User sessions,
      Rate limiting, Background tasks.
    end note

}

UI <--> API : HTTP/REST (JSON)
API <--> DB : SQL / TCP
API <..> Cache : TCP (Optional)

@enduml
